# clausal: no-collect
# Exporter for the import-error export-list diagnostic
# (todo/done/import-error-should-list-module-exports.md).
#
# Reproduces the shape of a vocabulary module whose -module(...) list is the
# authoritative answer to "what may I import from here?".
-module(impexp_schema, [
    verdict(STATUS, CITATIONS),
    beneficial_owner,
    not_beneficial_owner,
    holdings,
    person,
    entity,
    overall,
    as_of_date,
    exceeds_limit,
])

verdict(beneficial_owner, [])
